The following types are part of the stable API of `@remotion/media-parser`:

## `MediaParserDimensions`[](#mediaparserdimensions "Direct link to mediaparserdimensions")

```
import type {MediaParserDimensions} from '@remotion/media-parser';                      (alias) type MediaParserDimensions = {
    width: number;
    height: number;
}
import MediaParserDimensions
```

## `MediaParserAudioCodec`[](#mediaparseraudiocodec "Direct link to mediaparseraudiocodec")

```
import type {MediaParserAudioCodec} from '@remotion/media-parser';                      (alias) type MediaParserAudioCodec = "opus" | "aac" | "mp3" | "ac3" | "vorbis" | "pcm-u8" | "pcm-s16" | "pcm-s24" | "pcm-s32" | "pcm-f32" | "flac" | "aiff"
import MediaParserAudioCodec
```

More values may be added in the future, this would not be considered a breaking change.

## `MediaParserVideoCodec`[](#mediaparservideocodec "Direct link to mediaparservideocodec")

```
import type {MediaParserVideoCodec} from '@remotion/media-parser';                      (alias) type MediaParserVideoCodec = "vp8" | "vp9" | "h264" | "av1" | "h265" | "prores"
import MediaParserVideoCodec
```

More values may be added in the future, this would not be considered a breaking change.

## `MediaParserContainer`[](#mediaparsercontainer "Direct link to mediaparsercontainer")

```
import type {MediaParserContainer} from '@remotion/media-parser';                      (alias) type MediaParserContainer = "mp4" | "webm" | "avi" | "transport-stream" | "mp3" | "aac" | "flac" | "m3u8" | "wav"
import MediaParserContainer
```

More values may be added in the future, this would not be considered a breaking change.

## `MediaParserLocation`[](#mediaparserlocation "Direct link to mediaparserlocation")

```
import type {MediaParserLocation} from '@remotion/media-parser';                     (alias) type MediaParserLocation = {
    latitude: number;
    longitude: number;
    altitude: number | null;
    horizontalAccuracy: number | null;
}
import MediaParserLocation
```

## `MediaParserEmbeddedImage`[](#mediaparserembeddedimage "Direct link to mediaparserembeddedimage")

```
import type {MediaParserEmbeddedImage} from '@remotion/media-parser';                        (alias) type MediaParserEmbeddedImage = {
    description: string | null;
    mimeType: string | null;
    data: Uint8Array;
}
import MediaParserEmbeddedImage
```

-   `mimeType`: The MIME type of the image, or `null`
-   `description`: A description of the image, or `null`
-   `data`: The image data as a `Uint8Array`

## `MediaParserKeyframe`[](#mediaparserkeyframe "Direct link to mediaparserkeyframe")

```
import type {MediaParserKeyframe} from '@remotion/media-parser';                     (alias) type MediaParserKeyframe = {
    positionInBytes: number;
    sizeInBytes: number;
    presentationTimeInSeconds: number;
    decodingTimeInSeconds: number;
    trackId: number;
}
import MediaParserKeyframe
```

-   `presentationTimeInSeconds`: The time in seconds when the keyframe should be presented
-   `decodingTimeInSeconds`: The time in seconds when the keyframe should be decoded
-   `positionInBytes`: The position in bytes where the keyframe is located in the file
-   `sizeInBytes`: The size of the keyframe in bytes
-   `trackId`: The ID of the track the frame belongs to

